{"id":"U06","title":"Tips for Starting an Art Journey","titleZh":"开启艺术之旅的建议","paras":[{"id":"U06-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U06-P1-S1","hard":true,"text":"As an artist who shares her journey on social media, I'm often asked by curious followers how to begin an art journey."},{"id":"U06-P1-S2","hard":false,"text":"Unfortunately, there is no magic list I can offer."},{"id":"U06-P1-S3","hard":false,"text":"I do remember, though, what it was like to be a complete beginner."},{"id":"U06-P1-S4","hard":false,"text":"So I've put together some good tips for starting an art journey."}],"zh":"作为一名在社交媒体上分享自己艺术之旅的艺术家，我常常被好奇的粉丝们问到如何开始一段艺术旅程。遗憾的是，我没有什么神奇的清单可以提供。不过，我确实记得作为一个完全的新手是什么感觉。所以我整理了一些开启艺术之旅的好建议。"},{"id":"U06-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U06-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"Start small."},{"id":"U06-P2-S2","hard":false,"text":"I suggest using a sketchbook for small studies."},{"id":"U06-P2-S3","hard":false,"text":"These small studies provide inspiration and may be a springboard for more complex works in the future."},{"id":"U06-P2-S4","hard":false,"text":"Don't throw away your beginner art."},{"id":"U06-P2-S5","hard":false,"text":"You'll want to look back on your journey to see how far you've come."}],"zh":"从小处开始。我建议使用速写本进行小幅练习。这些小练习能提供灵感，也可能成为未来更复杂作品的跳板。不要扔掉你初学时的作品。你会想要回顾自己的旅程，看看自己已经走了多远。"},{"id":"U06-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U06-P3-S1","hard":false,"text":"Paint often and paint from life."},{"id":"U06-P3-S2","hard":false,"text":"There's no better way to improve than to put in those brush miles."},{"id":"U06-P3-S3","hard":false,"text":"Whether you paint still lifes, portraits, or landscapes, paint from life as much as possible."},{"id":"U06-P3-S4","hard":false,"text":"You'll develop that painting muscle memory that only comes with repetition."}],"zh":"经常画画，并且写生。没有比投入这些画笔里程更好的提高方式了。无论你画静物、肖像还是风景，都要尽可能多地写生。你会培养出只有反复练习才能获得的绘画肌肉记忆。"},{"id":"U06-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U06-P4-S1","hard":false,"text":"Continually challenge yourself to try something new."},{"id":"U06-P4-S2","hard":false,"text":"Get out of your comfort zone."},{"id":"U06-P4-S3","hard":false,"text":"Artistic growth can be a bit painful."},{"id":"U06-P4-S4","hard":false,"text":"Welcome to the club; we've all been there."},{"id":"U06-P4-S5","hard":false,"text":"I love taking on challenges."},{"id":"U06-P4-S6","hard":false,"text":"I once took up a challenge to create a painting every day for a month and post the works online."}],"zh":"不断挑战自己，尝试新事物。走出你的舒适区。艺术成长可能会有点痛苦。欢迎加入这个俱乐部，我们都经历过。我喜欢接受挑战。我曾经接受了一个挑战，连续一个月每天创作一幅画，并把作品发布到网上。"},{"id":"U06-P5","sentences":[{"id":"U06-P5-S1","hard":false,"text":"Share your work if you feel comfortable doing so."},{"id":"U06-P5-S2","hard":false,"text":"Seeking and accepting constructive feedback is crucial to growth."},{"id":"U06-P5-S3","hard":false,"text":"I post my work on social media and, in turn, have met some of the kindest people."},{"id":"U06-P5-S4","hard":false,"text":"They make me feel valued and respected, no matter my level of artistic ability."}],"zh":"如果你感觉自在，就分享你的作品。寻求并接受建设性的反馈对成长至关重要。我把自己的作品发布到社交媒体上，作为回报，我遇到了一些最友善的人。无论我的艺术水平如何，他们都让我感到被重视和尊重。"},{"id":"U06-P6","sentences":[{"id":"U06-P6-S1","hard":false,"text":"The journey you're on won't follow a straight path."},{"id":"U06-P6-S2","hard":false,"text":"You'll hit roadblocks, and you'll feel discouraged at times."},{"id":"U06-P6-S3","hard":false,"text":"Push through, give it time and put in the effort."},{"id":"U06-P6-S4","hard":false,"text":"You will harvest the rewards of an artistic life."}],"zh":"你正在走的旅程不会是一条笔直的道路。你会遇到障碍，有时会感到气馁。坚持下去，给它时间，付出努力。你会收获艺术生活的回报。"}],"words":[{"id":"U06-W01","lemma":"social","surface":"social","pos":"adj.","zh":"社交的; 社会的","sent":"U06-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"social media","zh":"社交媒体"},{"en":"social skills","zh":"社交技能"}]},{"id":"U06-W02","lemma":"media","surface":"media","pos":"n.","zh":"媒体; 媒介","sent":"U06-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"social media","zh":"社交媒体"},{"en":"mass media","zh":"大众媒体"}]},{"id":"U06-W03","lemma":"curious","surface":"curious","pos":"adj.","zh":"好奇的; 求知欲强的","sent":"U06-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"be curious about","zh":"对...好奇"}]},{"id":"U06-W04","lemma":"follower","surface":"followers","pos":"n.","zh":"追随者; 粉丝","sent":"U06-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"social media followers","zh":"社交媒体粉丝"}]},{"id":"U06-W05","lemma":"unfortunately","surface":"Unfortunately","pos":"adv.","zh":"遗憾地; 不幸地","sent":"U06-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"unfortunately for","zh":"对...来说遗憾的是"}]},{"id":"U06-W06","lemma":"magic","surface":"magic","pos":"n. / adj.","zh":"n. 魔法; 魔力 adj. 神奇的; 有魔力的","sent":"U06-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"magic list","zh":"神奇的清单"},{"en":"like magic","zh":"像变魔术一样"}]},{"id":"U06-W07","lemma":"remember","surface":"remember","pos":"v.","zh":"记得; 记住","sent":"U06-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"remember to do sth.","zh":"记得去做某事"},{"en":"remember doing sth.","zh":"记得做过某事"}]},{"id":"U06-W08","lemma":"though","surface":"though","pos":"adv. / conj.","zh":"adv. 不过; 然而 conj. 虽然; 尽管","sent":"U06-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"even though","zh":"即使"}]},{"id":"U06-W09","lemma":"complete","surface":"complete","pos":"adj. / v.","zh":"adj. 完全的; 完整的 v. 完成; 使完整","sent":"U06-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"a complete beginner","zh":"完全的新手"},{"en":"complete the task","zh":"完成任务"}]},{"id":"U06-W10","lemma":"beginner","surface":"beginner","pos":"n.","zh":"初学者; 新手","sent":"U06-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"complete beginner","zh":"完全的新手"}]},{"id":"U06-W11","lemma":"put together","surface":"put together","pos":"phr. v.","zh":"整理; 拼凑; 组装","sent":"U06-P1-S4","phrases":[{"en":"put together a list","zh":"整理一份清单"}]},{"id":"U06-W12","lemma":"tip","surface":"tips","pos":"n.","zh":"建议; 窍门; 小费","sent":"U06-P1-S4","phrases":[{"en":"good tips","zh":"好建议"},{"en":"useful tips","zh":"实用的窍门"}]},{"id":"U06-W13","lemma":"suggest","surface":"suggest","pos":"v.","zh":"建议; 暗示","sent":"U06-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"suggest doing sth.","zh":"建议做某事"},{"en":"suggest that","zh":"建议..."}]},{"id":"U06-W14","lemma":"sketchbook","surface":"sketchbook","pos":"n.","zh":"速写本; 素描簿","sent":"U06-P2-S2","phrases":[{"